# Any row = violation. THE LAW: every claim instance providing telemetry must
# cover ALL of its claim type's required fields (no partial provision on a
# record that stands). Vacuity falsifier: verify.py deletes one provided
# telemetry field from the positive control and PROVES this gate flips.
PREFIX el: <urn:trade:reticle:electrical:>
SELECT ?claim ?missing
WHERE {
  ?claim el:providedTelemetry ?provided .
  ?claim el:claimType ?ct .
  ?table a el:DiagnosticTree ;
         el:claimType ?ct ;
         el:requiredTelemetry ?req .
  FILTER NOT EXISTS {
    ?claim el:providedTelemetry ?req .
  }
  BIND(?req AS ?missing)
}
